From: John Stockdale <jstockdale@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: kaanapali-oneplus-iceland: S1J real voltage floor

Ours (2026-11-01, C3 radios): the S1J rail floor at the stock 892 mV; a lower
floor reset the SoC on radio power-on. Exit: submit to Perpetua with 0003/0004.

Signed-off-by: John Stockdale <jstockdale@gmail.com>
---
diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/kaanapali-oneplus-iceland.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/kaanapali-oneplus-iceland.dts
index 193a4a669b66..e3737a80aee7 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/kaanapali-oneplus-iceland.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/kaanapali-oneplus-iceland.dts
@@ -877,7 +877,7 @@ regulators-5 {
 
 		vreg_s1j_0p8: smps1 {
 			regulator-name = "vreg_s1j_0p8";
-			regulator-min-microvolt = <400000>;
+			regulator-min-microvolt = <892000>;
 			regulator-max-microvolt = <1000000>;
 			regulator-initial-mode = <RPMH_REGULATOR_MODE_HPM>;
 		};
